# Mutation cases for "the C++ parser routes on `sce:kind`".
#
# Run with `scripts/mutate tests/mutations/kind_routing.cases`.
#
# This is the round that made the harness speak ctest. The defect it stands
# for is the one A6 fixed: until this parser read `sce:kind`, it ran forge
# documents as statecharts while the Rust pipeline rejected them, so the two
# engines disagreed about what a document even was. That fix was verified by
# hand — rebuild, compare binary hashes, re-run, restore, compare again —
# because the harness could only express a cargo selector, which is exactly
# the procedure a tool exists to make repeatable.
#
# The suite named here is the one ctest case that owns the claim:
# `CrossProducerDiagnosticIdTests` runs both producers over a document per
# `sce:kind` spelling and asserts they agree on which pipeline owns it.
# Naming it rather than the whole tree keeps a case's verdict about the code
# it mutated.
#
# ⚠ This selector also named `DiagnosticTests`, on the reading that it
# asserted the routing table. Measured 2026-09-30, all three cases below turn
# `BothProducersAgreeOnWhichPipelineOwnsTheDocument` red and leave every
# `DiagnosticTests` case green: that suite checks the wire shape of a
# diagnostic, not what routes a document to it. A suite that cannot go red
# under any case adds nothing to a verdict but the time to run it.

mutation_ctest --test-dir build -R "^CrossProducerDiagnosticIdTests$"
mutation_targets sce/src/parsing/SCXMLParser.cpp
mutation_oracles tests/parsing/CrossProducerDiagnosticId_test.cpp

mutation_case "a document routed to Forge is parsed as a statechart" <<'PY'
edit("sce/src/parsing/SCXMLParser.cpp",
     '        if (kind != "statechart") {',
     '        if (false) {')
PY

mutation_case "the routing attribute is never read" <<'PY'
edit("sce/src/parsing/SCXMLParser.cpp",
     '    if (rootElement->hasAttribute("sce:kind")) {',
     '    if (false && rootElement->hasAttribute("sce:kind")) {')
PY

mutation_case "the engine's own documents are refused along with the rest" <<'PY'
edit("sce/src/parsing/SCXMLParser.cpp",
     '        if (kind != "statechart") {',
     '        if (kind == kind) {')
PY
